    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At the peak of Book Mountain in Green Lotus Dao field, Fairy Yu Xiu sits with Divine Emperor City’s learning Gu spreading radiance inside her immortal aperture. It cooperates with her other Immortal Gu to form the human path killer move Endless Learning. Light blue radiance covers Gu cultivators on the mountain and raises attainment levels by creating true meaning in their minds instead of spending the user’s true meaning. The move uses Fairy Yu Xiu’s attainment level, the secluded domain Book Mountain, and learning Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2163
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "book-mountain-activation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_book_mountain",
          "loc_green_lotus_great_world",
          "char_fairy_yu_xiu",
          "move_endless_learning"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Star Constellation Immortal Venerable revives and moves for Primordial Domain, Fairy Feng Ya’s talent Gu and Fairy Yu Xiu’s serious Gu and learning Gu, temporarily taken out from Divine Emperor City, activate one after another inside her immortal aperture while immortal essence is consumed intensely.",
        "chapters": [
          2184
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
