  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside qi howling painting world, Shen Shang and Fang Di Chang sense a rank eight Immortal Gu aura and find the Gu floating in the air, shining with radiance. They identify it as the learning Gu recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu. Fang Di Chang calls Learning Gu a human path Immortal Gu and likely the highest ranked human path Immortal Gu in the current world. Shen Shang links earlier beast tamers and qi cultivators in the painting to this Gu’s effect inside a killer move under Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable’s arrangements. Fang Di Chang treats Learning Gu as one of the cores of Divine Emperor City and as a crack in that city’s intact structure when it is used alone.",
        "chapters": [
          2163
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shen_shang",
          "char_fang_di_chang",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
          "house_divine_emperor_city"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fairy Yu Xiu’s Dao lessons recruit mutant Gu Immortals, Fang Yuan silently names Learning Gu and Endless Learning. He treats Endless Learning as the first killer move he has seen, outside dream realms, that can directly raise attainment levels, and judges it likely a new Heavenly Court creation. Lu Wei Yin warns that a unique true meaning method might help Heavenly Court enter or obtain Primordial Domain.",
        "chapters": [
          2164
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-names-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "char_lu_wei_yin",
          "loc_primordial_domain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In a Legends of Ren Zu excerpt, after serious Gu appears on Carefree Wisdom Heart while she digs for true meaning, a second Gu appears on her body and is called learning Gu. She converts knowledge into things she truly understands instead of only storing it with memory Gu. With self will Gu, learning Gu, and talent Gu she finds the true meaning of knowledge, which she says cannot be passed in speech or text.",
        "chapters": [
          2177
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "legend-birth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_serious_gu",
          "char_carefree_wisdom_heart",
          "gu_memory_gu",
          "gu_self_will_gu",
          "gu_talent_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later recounting places learning Gu among the cores of the human path killer move Endless Learning together with Book Mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          2293
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "endless-learning-core",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
